      <p><seg source="#source-10749-10752">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10752-10794"><rb>志願兵殿</rb><rt>しぐわんへいどの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10794-10797">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10797-10818"><rb>何時</rb><rt>なんじ</rt></ruby>でありますか‥‥」と、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10851-10872"><rb>背後</rb><rt>うしろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10872-10878">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10878-10899"><rb>兵士</rb><rt>へいし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10899-10902">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10902-10923"><rb>一人</rb><rt>ひとり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10923-10926">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10926-10941"><rb>訊</rb><rt>たづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10941-10952">ねた。</seg></p>
      <p>「一<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10958-10973"><rb>時</rb><rt>じ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10973-10979">十五</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10979-11006"><rb>分前</rb><rt>ふんまへ</rt></ruby>だ‥‥」と、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11024-11042"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11042-11045">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11045-11069"><rb>覺束</rb><rt>おぼつか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11069-11075">ない</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11075-11099"><rb>星明</rb><rt>ほしあか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11099-11105">りに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11105-11135"><rb>腕時計</rb><rt>うでどけい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11135-11150">をすかして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11150-11162"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11162-11171">ながら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11171-11186"><rb>答</rb><rt>こた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11186-11197">へた。</seg></p>
