      <p><seg source="#source-13340-13343">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13343-13358"><rb>痛</rb><rt>いた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13358-13364">い、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13364-13379"><rb>誰</rb><rt>だれ</rt></ruby>だつ‥‥」と、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13400-13418"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13418-13421">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13421-13439"><rb>體</rb><rt>からだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13439-13442">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13442-13454"><rb>踏</rb><rt>ふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13454-13457">み</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13457-13472"><rb>應</rb><rt>こた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13472-13490">へながらその</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13490-13511"><rb>兵士</rb><rt>へいし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13511-13514">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13514-13526"><rb>突</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13526-13529">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13529-13541"><rb>飛</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13541-13559">ばした。と、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13559-13574"><rb>彼</rb><rt>かれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13574-13577">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13577-13592"><rb>闇</rb><rt>やみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13592-13595">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13595-13610"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13610-13634">をひよろけてまた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13634-13655"><rb>背後</rb><rt>はいご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13655-13658">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13658-13679"><rb>兵士</rb><rt>へいし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13679-13682">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13682-13694"><rb>突</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg sou