      <p>「とんだ五九<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27646-27664"><rb>郎</rb><rt>らう</rt></ruby>だ‥‥」と、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27682-27697"><rb>誰</rb><rt>だれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27697-27703">かが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27703-27721"><rb>呟</rb><rt>つぶや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27721-27730">いた。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27730-27745"><rb>劇</rb><rt>はげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27745-27751">しい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27751-27775"><rb>笑聲</rb><rt>せうせい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27775-27787">がわつと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27787-27802"><rb>起</rb><rt>おこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27802-27813">つた。</seg></p>
